{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 46,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        83.1881103515625,
        510.54248046875,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "If a child presents with infectious TB, other child contacts must be sought and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        86.86001586914062,
        91.36740112304688,
        94.86001586914062
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        99.18463134765625,
        510.6231689453125,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "screened, as for any smear-positive source case. Children should be regarded as",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        115.18115234375,
        510.5424499511719,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "infectious if they have sputum smear-positive pulmonary TB or cavitary TB on chest",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        131.17767333984375,
        386.4805603027344,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "X-ray (not uncommon in older children and adolescents).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        153.10818481445312,
        136.1484832763672,
        166.5286865234375
      ],
      "text": "Symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        177.692138671875,
        510.6085205078125,
        191.04364013671875
      ],
      "text": "In most cases, children with symptomatic TB develop chronic unremitting symptoms,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.68865966796875,
        510.5854797363281,
        207.0401611328125
      ],
      "text": "i.e. symptoms that persist for more than 2 weeks without sustained improvement or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        209.6851806640625,
        510.5855712890625,
        223.03668212890625
      ],
      "text": "resolution following appropriate treatment for other potential diagnoses (e.g. antibiotics",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        225.68170166015625,
        510.5740051269531,
        239.033203125
      ],
      "text": "for pneumonia; antimalarials for fever; nutritional support for failure to thrive). The",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        241.67822265625,
        240.30087280273438,
        255.02972412109375
      ],
      "text": "commonest symptoms include:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        263.99603271484375,
        151.17140197753906,
        277.4625244140625
      ],
      "text": "cough -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        283.46533203125,
        144.75440979003906,
        296.93182373046875
      ],
      "text": "fever -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        302.93463134765625,
        238.4908905029297,
        316.401123046875
      ],
      "text": "not eating well/anorexia -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        322.4039001464844,
        266.59686279296875,
        335.8703918457031
      ],
      "text": "weight loss or failure to thrive -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        341.8731994628906,
        352.2143249511719,
        355.3396911621094
      ],
      "text": "fatigue, reduced playfulness, decreased activity. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        363.5391845703125,
        510.52337646484375,
        376.89068603515625
      ],
      "text": "In addition to asking about weight loss or failure to thrive, it is important to look at the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        379.5356750488281,
        510.569580078125,
        392.8871765136719
      ],
      "text": "child’s growth chart if available. Other or additional symptoms will be present in various",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        395.53216552734375,
        510.5925598144531,
        408.8836669921875
      ],
      "text": "forms of extrapulmonary TB (i.e. TB of organs other than the lungs) and will depend on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        411.5286560058594,
        432.46148681640625,
        424.8801574707031
      ],
      "text": "the site of disease (e.g. enlarged lymph nodes, back swelling, seizures).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        436.03515625,
        510.53521728515625,
        449.38665771484375
      ],
      "text": "The specificity of symptoms for the diagnosis of TB depends on how strict the definitions",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        452.0316467285156,
        510.5579528808594,
        465.3831481933594
      ],
      "text": "of the symptoms are. However, no definite cut-offs, e.g. duration of symptoms, have",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        468.02813720703125,
        510.54638671875,
        481.379638671875
      ],
      "text": "been validated and accuracy will depend on context. Strict symptom criteria have",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        484.0246276855469,
        510.55792236328125,
        497.3761291503906
      ],
      "text": "lower sensitivity and specificity in those at greatest risk of severe disease and poor",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        500.0211181640625,
        510.6271057128906,
        513.3726196289062
      ],
      "text": "outcome such as infants or very young children (under 3 years), children living with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        515.9486694335938,
        510.59259033203125,
        529.369140625
      ],
      "text": "(1) HIV, or severely malnourished children  . These groups pose the greatest challenge for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        532.0140991210938,
        172.57289123535156,
        545.3656005859375
      ],
      "text": "clinical diagnosis.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        559.2069091796875,
        375.0672912597656,
        573.4268798828125
      ],
      "text": "Clinical examination (including growth assessment)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        581.9503784179688,
        510.5622863769531,
        595.3018798828125
      ],
      "text": "There are no specific features on clinical examination that can confirm that the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        597.9468994140625,
        510.5624084472656,
        611.2984008789062
      ],
      "text": "presenting illness is due to pulmonary TB. Some clinical signs, although uncommon,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        613.9434204101562,
        510.59698486328125,
        627.294921875
      ],
      "text": "are highly suggestive of extrapulmonary TB. Other signs are less specific, but should still",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        629.93994140625,
        414.9743347167969,
        643.2914428710938
      ],
      "text": "prompt a diagnostic evaluation for TB. Important physical signs are:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        654.3853149414062,
        368.9774475097656,
        667.8057861328125
      ],
      "text": "Physical signs highly suggestive of extrapulmonary TB:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        658.1261596679688,
        91.36730194091797,
        666.1261596679688
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63929748535156,
        674.2543334960938,
        425.28533935546875,
        687.7208251953125
      ],
      "text": "gibbus, especially of recent onset (resulting from vertebral TB); -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63929748535156,
        693.7236328125,
        510.5807800292969,
        707.1901245117188
      ],
      "text": "non-painful enlarged cervical lymphadenopathy, with or without fistula  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        169.0417938232422,
        706.528076171875,
        172.37779235839844,
        722.5001220703125
      ],
      "text": ".",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.48930358886719,
        708.1216430664062,
        169.0422821044922,
        721.47314453125
      ],
      "text": "formation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        729.7239379882812,
        434.7804870605469,
        743.1444091796875
      ],
      "text": "Physical signs requiring investigation to exclude extrapulmonary TB:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        733.4647827148438,
        91.36730194091797,
        741.4647827148438
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63929748535156,
        749.5928955078125,
        507.42974853515625,
        763.0593872070312
      ],
      "text": "meningitis not responding to antibiotic treatment, with a subacute onset and/ -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.48930358886719,
        763.3928833007812,
        267.0222473144531,
        776.744384765625
      ],
      "text": "or raised intracranial pressure;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "27",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}